{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54299","headline":"颂 三 · 克符道者","name":"颂 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人境两俱夺，从来正令行。\n不论佛与祖，那说圣凡情。\n拟犯吹毛剑，还伤（《五灯会元》、《人天眼目》作「如」）值木（《人天眼目》作「目」）盲。\n进前求妙会，特地打（《五灯会元》、《人天眼目》作「斩」）精灵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"克符道者","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}